{
    "word": "free-for-all",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "ff5a4180-a956-3906-bbcb-19665a91339b",
                "word": "free-for-all",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "13e38d32-1a07-3c93-8b28-a47334b7ea2f",
                        "entry_id": "ff5a4180-a956-3906-bbcb-19665a91339b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Open to anyone and with no or few rules."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "de214787-d5cc-4cf0-8540-3b3eecde5497",
                                "sense_id": "13e38d32-1a07-3c93-8b28-a47334b7ea2f",
                                "text": "Men, as well as women, were springing in to the rope and pulling. No longer was it team against team, but all Oakland against all San Francisco, festooned with a free-for-all fight."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3e6c74e9-521a-4735-8448-88306e687408",
                                "sense_id": "13e38d32-1a07-3c93-8b28-a47334b7ea2f",
                                "text": "Then Lucy told him about the great passion of her father—about the long, time-honored custom of free-for-all races, and the great races that had been run in the past; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "89ca1dd2-fddc-4704-ba5b-78f5121a0e95",
                                "sense_id": "13e38d32-1a07-3c93-8b28-a47334b7ea2f",
                                "text": "But, he added, “Twitter obviously cannot become a free-for-all hellscape where anything can be said with no consequences!”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "90bf9181-9898-3f5a-a916-efd18a3b6be5",
                "word": "free-for-all",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "b789d93b-05a6-48af-8625-771e3351dd52",
                        "entry_id": "90bf9181-9898-3f5a-a916-efd18a3b6be5",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "free-for-alls"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "10f660fa-91ee-3f26-b59d-1f73809338e5",
                        "entry_id": "90bf9181-9898-3f5a-a916-efd18a3b6be5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Chaos; a chaotic situation lacking rules or control."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "86c13523-4178-467c-8f60-ae1a9dcdba71",
                                "sense_id": "10f660fa-91ee-3f26-b59d-1f73809338e5",
                                "text": "When the fire alarm went off, it was a free-for-all."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb22f3b2-1bc0-467f-8a99-1fc2e3730850",
                                "sense_id": "10f660fa-91ee-3f26-b59d-1f73809338e5",
                                "text": "Competition was the order of the day: the industrial warfare of the sixties was a free-for-all."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "721d8440-dcf9-4d7e-9e70-730cdc5585d6",
                                "sense_id": "10f660fa-91ee-3f26-b59d-1f73809338e5",
                                "text": "[…] this was a consequence of building Tubes by means of a competitive free-for-all. Each company wanted to expand its territory at the expense of the others."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "10436085-779e-3f0b-ac2e-7a1a959dea66",
                        "entry_id": "90bf9181-9898-3f5a-a916-efd18a3b6be5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Deathmatch, sometimes specifically one in which every player is pitted against all the others."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "802bdf10-d9ac-4a2b-96f2-82eea036c3c3",
                        "source_entry_id": "90bf9181-9898-3f5a-a916-efd18a3b6be5",
                        "source_sense_description": "chaos",
                        "target_lang_word": "pagaille",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pagaille",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ee2797a2-1ba9-30df-beb8-470742c4505d",
                                        "entry_id": "3194f9ca-782a-3fbe-8d02-7d5fccc41f50",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Désordre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "familiar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f301a07-c6c2-4b6f-a46c-994cbec77c2b",
                                                "sense_id": "ee2797a2-1ba9-30df-beb8-470742c4505d",
                                                "text": "Tandis que le convoi d'artillerie évitait Malmédy, une pagaille indescriptible régnait dans la ville."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3c7121d-ba2d-4529-b87f-636588d448dc",
                                                "sense_id": "ee2797a2-1ba9-30df-beb8-470742c4505d",
                                                "text": "Un mort dans l’Isère, le trafic ferroviaire en partie bloqué à Grenoble et environ 245 000 foyers privés d’électricité dans onze départements : la neige tombant en abondance a semé la pagaille et provoqué un drame dans la région Auvergne-Rhône-Alpes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28d0a8ec-9c84-4427-884b-d32414eefeb8",
                                                "sense_id": "ee2797a2-1ba9-30df-beb8-470742c4505d",
                                                "text": "Avec votre ferraille\nOn forge ces engins\nQui foutront la pagaille\nParmi ceux du voisin"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "12df21f5-988b-4f52-b3ee-d99d178e9430",
                        "source_entry_id": "90bf9181-9898-3f5a-a916-efd18a3b6be5",
                        "source_sense_description": "chaos",
                        "target_lang_word": "chacun pour soi",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "chacun pour soi",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "598f38ea-fc53-3317-8812-24bfe8cba0e1",
                                        "entry_id": "828048b4-d6e3-3648-8d03-74354c461c77",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dans un but personnel et égoïste."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "familiar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e271c29-6925-4135-bab8-53211c695d1f",
                                                "sense_id": "598f38ea-fc53-3317-8812-24bfe8cba0e1",
                                                "text": "Et ils ont cherché à accaparer, chacun pour soi, la plus grande quantité de jouissances possible, sans s’occuper des intérêts d’autrui."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26d4080d-4136-4e5a-8bb6-39b3ba6b6d11",
                                                "sense_id": "598f38ea-fc53-3317-8812-24bfe8cba0e1",
                                                "text": "La solidarité se perd, maintenant c’est chacun pour soi."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "chacun pour soi",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d8948064-b2c3-37a0-853f-5d4648025fb0",
                                        "entry_id": "4474a405-0fd4-3139-93de-fe7eb87b3536",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Individualisme égoïste."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "familiar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3a2d37e-4d65-4557-a095-67b29583abb6",
                                                "sense_id": "d8948064-b2c3-37a0-853f-5d4648025fb0",
                                                "text": "Nous nous réunîmes une dernière fois, mes quelques hommes survivants et moi, et décidâmes de tenter notre chance suivant la règle du « chacun pour soi »."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c123861a-b9d0-43be-991f-040c3d12006d",
                                                "sense_id": "d8948064-b2c3-37a0-853f-5d4648025fb0",
                                                "text": "La philosophie qui préconisait l’intérêt personnel comme solution sociale était une synthèse excellente, vivante et efficace, à l’époque où la civilisation reculait ses frontières de vingt milles par jour sur le continent américain, et le « chacun pour soi » était alors la meilleure mobilisation sociale qui fût possible.\nMais aujourd’hui, ce n’est plus qu’un fantôme attardé qui n’a pas obéi au chant du coq. La morale de frontière qu’était alors le « chacun pour soi » est devenue contraire d’une morale depuis que la frontière est abolie et que le pionnier est devenu le citoyen."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e7f12b4c-ef3d-39f0-a776-f5d7bcc895fa",
                                        "entry_id": "4474a405-0fd4-3139-93de-fe7eb87b3536",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(Philosophie) seul l'individu défend son propre intérêt. référence nécessaire (résoudre le problème)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
